//DEVELOPMENT
### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts

### Get contact by id
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/69ac67d6f6a8a675283fdc35


### Create a new contact
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json  

{
  "firstName": "Mike",
  "lastName": "Johnson",
  "email": "mike.johnson@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Blue",
  "birthday": "1990-07-08"
}


### Update a contact
PUT http://localhost:3000/contacts/69b57a3fc7962b7f61dc186c 
Content-Type: application/json  

{
  "firstName": "Mike",
  "lastName": "Johnson",
  "email": "mike.johnson@update_example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Blue",
  "birthday": "1990-07-08"
}


### Delete a contact
DELETE http://localhost:3000/contacts/69b57a3fc7962b7f61dc186c


